<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech FinMin sets 4-wk T-bill auction for Tuesday.</title>
<headline>Czech FinMin sets 4-wk T-bill auction for Tuesday.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Czech National Bank on Monday set a Dutch auction for Tuesday offering four billion crowns in four-week treasury bills, with maximum gross yield set at 12.15 percent.</p>
<p>It is the first auction of T-bills with such a maturity this year.</p>
<p>The one-month Prague interbank offered rate (PRIBOR) stood at 12.32 percent on Monday, down four basis points from Friday.</p>
<p>-- Prague Newsroom, 420-2-2423-0003</p>
</text>
